                                                                                                                                               "typeClass":  "primitive",
                                                                                                                                               "value":  "This dataset contains data collected during the agricultural season 2021. The experimentation was conducted in two fields located at the Desmaisieres farms: 1) wet seeding and continuous flooding (Control); 2) 14% reduction in water inflow/outflow during whole crop cycle and  22% reduction in water inflow/outflow from day 100 after sowing (RT2). The dataset includes also the experimental layouts of the pilot fields and the rice varieties cultivated under each irrigation treatment."
                                                                                                                                           }
